## 2. SQL Data Transformation & Standardization Layer

### Business Context & Data Strategy
Before performing exploratory data analysis (EDA) and executive dashboarding, raw customer feedback data requires normalization. 
This SQL script extracts raw telemetry from dataset and prepares a cleaned analytical view optimized for Tableau. 

-- =============================================================================
-- Data Transformation & Standardization Layer
-- Target Table: workspace.default.customer_satisfication_dataset
-- Destination View: customer_satisfaction_cleaned
-- =============================================================================

CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW workspace.default.customer_satisfaction_cleaned AS
SELECT
    Customer_ID,
    `Group` AS Customer_Group,
    Age,
    
    -- Standardized Gender Identifier
    CASE 
        WHEN Gender = 'Male' THEN 'M'
        WHEN Gender = 'Female' THEN 'F'
        ELSE 'Other'
    END AS Gender_Code,
    
    -- Split Location into City and State
    TRIM(SUBSTRING_INDEX(Location, '.', 1)) AS City,
    TRIM(SUBSTRING_INDEX(Location, '.', -1)) AS State,
    Latitude,
    Longitude,
    
    -- CSAT Raw Score & NPS/CSAT Tiers
    Satisfaction_Score,
    CASE 
        WHEN Satisfaction_Score >= 9 THEN 'Promoter'
        WHEN Satisfaction_Score >= 7 THEN 'Passive'
        ELSE 'Detractor'
    END AS CSAT_Segment,
    
    -- Behavioral & Operational Variables
    Purchase_History,
    CASE WHEN Purchase_History = 'Yes' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS Is_Repeat_Purchaser,
    Support_Contacted,
    Loyalty_Level,
    Satisfaction_Factor
    
FROM workspace.default.customer_satisfication_dataset;

